trator + by_type override applied for agent: orchestrator (source: chat.params) + ALLOW: gated git with active issue. Builder commit gated on #204 (active).","created_at":"2026-08-06T03:54:40.676803048Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:H5ghTa8b3msD8Xr7TIYwFItdozEhSiuiNgogDMOUJwk","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgyJ7nhRRXNF0CA6VQXpFc9DUNe3u782VdxurYyjvsO7IAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAh8gk9NRlHHEyWsjfIqBm4vJJE9jjzVng5qW5/cHVzX4/SYHEZqzpTebAQahYQG87QcXxzDzI3GCwBfHDHh8bBg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:H5ghTa8b3msD8Xr7TIYwFItdozEhSiuiNgogDMOUJwk","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgyJ7nhRRXNF0CA6VQXpFc9DUNe3u782VdxurYyjvsO7IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP7JN21JrkZ9iDTi30jATss2pT1Xr61ALRsNjeJNfYDJdFpKcI4gbWpMWZNpEpFvlUzoa0mZmFxhrIB6PQvXLgo="}
